  <entry>
    <title>镜像打包</title>
    <link href="/2025/%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85/"/>
    <url>/2025/%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="命令"><a href="#命令" class="headerlink" title="命令"></a>命令</h3><p>解压openjdk包</p><figure class="highlight apache"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs apache"><span class="hljs-attribute">tar</span> -zxvf openjdk-<span class="hljs-number">12</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">2</span>_linux-x64_bin.tar_2.gz -C /opt/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>查看当前环境变量</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$PATH</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> PATH=/opt/jdk-12.0.2/bin/:<span class="hljs-variable">$PATH</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>关闭防火墙</p><figure class="highlight arduino"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs arduino">systemctl stop firewalld<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p> build镜像过程中，查询详细信息<br> <figure class="highlight apache"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs apache"><span class="hljs-attribute">docker</span> build --progress=plain -t solo:<span class="hljs-number">1</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span> .<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><h3 id="问题"><a href="#问题" class="headerlink" title="问题"></a>问题</h3><p> dockerfile 中<br> <figure class="highlight dockerfile"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dockerfile"><span class="hljs-keyword">RUN</span><span class="language-bash"> <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;192.168.128.128 www.hcie.com&quot;</span> &gt;&gt; /etc/hosts</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br> 报错，readonly 写入报错</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>迁移</title>
    <link href="/2025/%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB/"/>
    <url>/2025/%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>文件级迁移 只迁移已又文件数据<br>块级迁移 全部迁移</p><p>启动绝对路径</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">java -<span class="hljs-built_in">cp</span> /opt/solo/lib/*:/opt/solo org.b3log.solo.Server<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 在solo目录下执行</span><br>java -<span class="hljs-built_in">cp</span> /opt/solo/lib/*:. org.b3log.solo.Server<br>java -<span class="hljs-built_in">cp</span> lib/*:. org.b3log.solo.Server<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>lscpu 查看cpu核数<br>lsblk 查看磁盘<br>free -m 查看内存 </p><p>RUN echo “192.168.128.128 <a href="http://www.hcie.com/">www.hcie.com</a>“ &gt;&gt; &#x2F;etc&#x2F;hosts &amp;&amp; rm -rf &#x2F;etc&#x2F;yum.repos.d&#x2F;C* &amp;&amp; yum -y install unzip &amp;&amp; unzip -q &#x2F;opt&#x2F;solo&#x2F;solo-v4.4.0.zip -d &#x2F;opt&#x2F;solo&#x2F; &amp;&amp; rm -rf &#x2F;opt&#x2F;solo&#x2F;solo-v4.4.0.zip</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
